{
	"info": {
		"name": "Dossiq API Contract Suite",
		"description": "Newman/Postman API-contract tests for the Dossiq Nextcloud app. Locks the HTTP contract of dossiq's controllers (appinfo/routes.php + lib/Controller/*): the status-transition engine, case (zaak) CRUD via the OpenRegister object API, complaints, and settings. Every endpoint family is exercised for a happy path, an error/validation case (4xx not 500), and an authorization case (no/invalid auth -> 401/403). The suite is self-contained and idempotent: it seeds prerequisite OpenRegister objects in setup requests and deletes everything it creates in teardown.\n\nAUTH MODEL: collection auth is noauth; every authenticated request carries an EXPLICIT basic-auth block (admin:admin via the adminUser/adminPass variables). This avoids any collection-inheritance/override ambiguity in Newman, so no-auth requests are deterministically unauthenticated.\n\nUsage: see run-newman.sh. Pass collection variables baseUrl, adminUser, adminPass.\n\nPhase-0 fixes locked here: (1) the transition engine returns real available-transitions/current/history data, (2) the controller body-parsing (getParams, not the protected getContent) no longer 500s, (3) an unavailable guarded transition is rejected with 409 (GuardFailedException) not 500.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
